IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-ZMM-RING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-RING-NODES      PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 REGISTERS-NODE      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 JITTER-X10          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ZMM-RING.
    IF NUM-RING-NODES == 0 OR REGISTERS-NODE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 5 TO JITTER-X10.
    MOVE 55800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-RING-NODES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
